00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:34.560
So it has an Asian portfolio.

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:38.850
The US markets for equities--
it has a US portfolio.

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:40.470
And that's Example.

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:44.970
It's something that you can all
identify with and it resonates

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:47.280
