00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:25.580
And the answer should be yes.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:29.480
Can Corrie, who is also
a member of FX analysts,

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:31.210
delete an equities project?

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:34.100
And the answer should be
willingly or unwillingly,

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:36.130
accidentally or not, no.

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:43.270
So now let's have a
look at the technologies

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:44.390
that we're going to use.

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:47.860
G Suite-- I'm not going to
